  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head section-head--run">
      <h2 class="headline-run">A record that stays current, not a spreadsheet that goes stale.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="split split--top">
      <div>
        <p>Most asset registries are static — untouched since commissioning. Asset Intelligence keeps the record current: every inspection and work order touchpoint updates the asset profile.</p>
        <p>That profile includes asset hierarchy, condition and performance history, criticality scoring, location, photos, and a live compliance status. It's the layer every other Assetas module reads from and writes to.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="top-card">
          <div class="top-card-panel">
            <ul class="tags tags--white">
              <li>ISO 55000 • Asset Management</li>
              <li>ISO 14224 • Maintenance and Reliability</li>
              <li>API 653 • Storage Tanks</li>
              <li>ISO 50001 • Energy Management</li>
              <li>PHMSA 49 CFR 192/195 • Pipelines</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <p>Aligned to global standards; adaptable to your needs.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

